# Text is stored and checked out as LF everywhere: these standards are consumed by
# repositories on Windows, macOS, and Linux alike. Windows-only script formats that
# require CRLF are the exception.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.pbxproj text eol=lf
*.xcscheme text eol=lf
